  "title": {
   "en": "Kotodama Kanaete! Tokie-sensei"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "コトダマ叶えて！ ときえ先生"
   },
   {
    "en": "Through the Power of Words, Grant Me My Wishes, Tokie-sensei"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In a normal, everyday run-of-the-mill school, a new teacher arrives but there's something peculiar about her... She's a teacher with a dark aura but with the power of words she can transform into whatever is asked of her. From dressing like a cat to wearing a bikini, she's at the mercy of her students. Enjoy this comedic story filled with very amusing moments between a teacher who thrives on obeying words and some very mischievous students.",
   "ja": "小学校で教師を務める御吾妻時恵は、生徒たちに言霊の大切さを教えようとしていた。ボサボサにのびた髪にジャージ姿と、陰気な格好をしていた彼女に対し、生徒たちが綺麗にしてほしいと声をかけた瞬間、彼女の姿は美しく変貌した!! 言霊の力を目の当たりにした生徒たちは、ときえ先生に次々と言霊を投げかけていく…!!"
  },
